{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "talkora-api-collection-v1",
    "name": "Talkora API",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for the Talkora full-stack Reddit-like community platform API.\n\n### Authentication Instructions\nTalkora uses secure, HttpOnly cookies for session management:\n- `talkora_access`: Short-lived access token cookie (15m)\n- `talkora_refresh`: Long-lived refresh token cookie (7d)\n\n**Postman Cookie Jar Handling:**\nPostman automatically handles Set-Cookie headers and stores cookies in its Cookie Jar for `localhost`. Ensure that the Postman cookie manager is enabled so subsequent requests automatically include your session cookies.\n\n### Recommended Execution Order:\n1. Health -> Check Service Health\n2. Authentication -> Register User or Login User\n3. Users -> Get Current User Profile (/auth/me)\n4. Posts -> Create Post (saves `testPostId`)\n5. Votes -> Cast Upvote\n6. Comments -> Create Comment (saves `testCommentId`)\n7. Feed Sorting -> Test newest, top, and downvoted feeds\n8. Authentication -> Logout",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Check Service Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Checks backend uptime and database connection status."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Service status is ok', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alex@talkora.dev\",\n  \"username\": \"alexdev\",\n  \"displayName\": \"Alex Developer\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Registers a new user and sets HttpOnly session cookies."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201 Created or 409 Conflict', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([201, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"alexdev\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Logs in by email or username, issuing fresh session cookies."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.user) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('testUsername', json.data.user.username);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Authenticated Profile (/auth/me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves the currently authenticated user session details."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Rotates session tokens using the HttpOnly refresh token cookie."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Revokes active session in PostgreSQL and clears authentication cookies."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Public Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/{{testUsername}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{testUsername}}"]
            },
            "description": "Fetches public profile data and recent posts for a given username."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Own Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Alex Dev (Updated)\",\n  \"bio\": \"Passionate about building scalable backend systems.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Updates profile details for the authenticated user."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Posts",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Post (Text Only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Architecting Talkora with Express 5 & Neon PostgreSQL\",\n  \"content\": \"In this post we review the performance of PostgreSQL-level ranking, atomic voting, and HttpOnly session cookies.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts"]
            },
            "description": "Creates a new text-only discussion post."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201 Created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.post) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('testPostId', json.data.post.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Post (With Image Multipart)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "title",
                  "value": "Post with an Image Upload",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "content",
                  "value": "Check out this visual architecture overview.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "description": "Select a JPEG, PNG, or WebP image under 5 MB"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts"]
            },
            "description": "Creates a post with an uploaded image via Multer and Cloudinary."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Post Details",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts/{{testPostId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts", "{{testPostId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves post by ID including author, comment count, upvotes, downvotes, score, and userVote."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Edit Post Text",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Architecting Talkora with Express 5 & Neon PostgreSQL (Edited)\",\n  \"content\": \"Updated content with additional insights on connection pooling and query optimization.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts/{{testPostId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts", "{{testPostId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Edits post title or content. Author only."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Post",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts/{{testPostId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts", "{{testPostId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Deletes the post, cascading to comments, votes, and Cloudinary. Author only."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 204 No Content', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Comments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Comment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"This is a thoughtful comment contributing to the conversation!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts/{{testPostId}}/comments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts", "{{testPostId}}", "comments"]
            },
            "description": "Adds a comment to the specified post. Authenticated only."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201 Created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.comment) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('testCommentId', json.data.comment.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List Comments",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts/{{testPostId}}/comments?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts", "{{testPostId}}", "comments"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Fetches paginated comments ordered newest first."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Edit Comment",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"Updated comment with corrected clarification.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/comments/{{testCommentId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["comments", "{{testCommentId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Edits a comment. Author only."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Comment",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/comments/{{testCommentId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["comments", "{{testCommentId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Deletes a comment. Author only."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 204 No Content', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Votes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cast Upvote",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"UPVOTE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts/{{testPostId}}/vote",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts", "{{testPostId}}", "vote"]
            },
            "description": "Atomically records an upvote on the post."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.expect(json.data.userVote).to.eql('UPVOTE');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Change to Downvote",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"DOWNVOTE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts/{{testPostId}}/vote",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts", "{{testPostId}}", "vote"]
            },
            "description": "Changes the vote to a downvote atomically."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.expect(json.data.userVote).to.eql('DOWNVOTE');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Post Vote Stats",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts/{{testPostId}}/vote",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts", "{{testPostId}}", "vote"]
            },
            "description": "Public endpoint retrieving upvotes, downvotes, net score, and requesting user's vote."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove Vote",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts/{{testPostId}}/vote",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts", "{{testPostId}}", "vote"]
            },
            "description": "Idempotently deletes the authenticated user's vote."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Feed Sorting",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Feed: Default / Newest",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts?sort=newest&page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "sort", "value": "newest" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves public feed sorted by newest (createdAt DESC)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Feed: Top Ranked",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts?sort=top&page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "sort", "value": "top" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves public feed sorted by net score descending (upvotes - downvotes DESC)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Feed: Downvoted",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/posts?sort=downvoted&page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["posts"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "sort", "value": "downvoted" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves public feed sorted by net score ascending (lowest scoring first)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
